    "body": "What kind of issues are you running into? There's a lot of cleanup-type tasks that affect the entire resource. If it were split up that would be harder to do correctly.\r\n\r\nIf we can split out more, as we did with XMLHttpRequest, Fetch, Encoding, URL, etc. that'd be my preference. Though I'm not sure there's anything that's a big enough win to be really worth it.",
